  "snp1.1:9.2": "Bodhi, Norman, and Ṭhānissaro all render <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vitatha</i> as “unreal”. This seems overly idealistic for early Buddhism, so I take the prefix <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vi</i> in the sense of “distorts”, “twists”. ",
